{"1553260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scarlet Deer Inn", "steam_appid": 1553260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4828180, 4955870], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Works great on Steam Deck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're still waiting for Valve to officially verify Scarlet Deer Inn, but we designed the game to work well on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/1c42bf85906db4e8f1c85e5430817204.poster.avif?t=1787751153\" width=550 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/1c42bf85906db4e8f1c85e5430817204.webm?t=1787751153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/1c42bf85906db4e8f1c85e5430817204.mp4?t=1787751153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><u><strong>ABOUT</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scarlet Deer Inn is an embroidered dark medieval folk tale. While life in a seemingly ordinary village is all about simple chores and idle gossip, sinister secrets hide below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/bacd0c4b9d00409eb41d8fcaafba519b.avif?t=1787751153\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-painted backgrounds and traditional animations crafted from physically embroidered frames. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world filled with colourful characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden shortcuts in the dark that make each playthrough easier. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Folk music inspired by the Middle Ages and performed on traditional instruments.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elise is a mother of two. She is not exactly extraordinary, and there are no heroic epics written about her.   <br>Her circumstances will force  her to explore unusual places and face dark, terrifying situations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE TEAM</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attu Games is a husband-and-wife team from the Czech Republic. During the development of Scarlet Deer Inn, their duo expanded into a trio with the birth of their baby, bringing a whole new level of chaos to the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/2536c4497c843fae8e454a196d2d8d5f.avif?t=1787751153\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Works great on Steam Deck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're still waiting for Valve to officially verify Scarlet Deer Inn, but we designed the game to work well on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/1c42bf85906db4e8f1c85e5430817204.poster.avif?t=1787751153\" width=550 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/1c42bf85906db4e8f1c85e5430817204.webm?t=1787751153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/1c42bf85906db4e8f1c85e5430817204.mp4?t=1787751153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><u><strong>ABOUT</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scarlet Deer Inn is an embroidered dark medieval folk tale. While life in a seemingly ordinary village is all about simple chores and idle gossip, sinister secrets hide below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/bacd0c4b9d00409eb41d8fcaafba519b.avif?t=1787751153\" width=600 height=114 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-painted backgrounds and traditional animations crafted from physically embroidered frames. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world filled with colourful characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden shortcuts in the dark that make each playthrough easier. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Folk music inspired by the Middle Ages and performed on traditional instruments.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elise is a mother of two. She is not exactly extraordinary, and there are no heroic epics written about her.   <br>Her circumstances will force  her to explore unusual places and face dark, terrifying situations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE TEAM</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attu Games is a husband-and-wife team from the Czech Republic. During the development of Scarlet Deer Inn, their duo expanded into a trio with the birth of their baby, bringing a whole new level of chaos to the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/2536c4497c843fae8